# Extrapolate the Impossible with nothing outside the game: there is no card to reveal, so nothing is asked and nothing
# moves - Bot2's Shock is outside the game too, but it is Bot2's and not a card Bot1 owns (CR 108.3b, 400.11a). The
# positive control is extrapolate-the-impossible-reveals-two-and-puts-the-opponents-pick-into-hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Extrapolate the Impossible
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot2 Sideboard]
Shock

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Extrapolate the Impossible.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Sideboard.Count = 0
Bot2.Sideboard = Shock
Bot1.Graveyard = Extrapolate the Impossible
Stack.Count = 0
